        <mxCell id="X5ilICROq1YAWeTVaS0U-8" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#222222;fontColor=#222222;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Knows&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Current identity/account and selected interface role.&lt;br&gt;• Initialization state and foreground-work lifecycle.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Does&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Show workspaces allowed by the account’s roles.&lt;br&gt;• Switch workspaces while keeping the same account identity.&lt;br&gt;• Request owner capability through AccountRepository; never grant&lt;br&gt;ADMIN.&lt;br&gt;• Bootstrap device identity and retrieve or initialize the account.&lt;br&gt;• Expose session state, initialization errors, and retry actions.&lt;br&gt;• Arrange foreground execution of resumable work after initialization.&lt;br&gt;• Establish or retrieve device-linked identity without username/password&lt;br&gt;login.&lt;br&gt;• Supply the account ID and report initialization failures.&lt;br&gt;• notification-token registration/removal" vertex="1">
